Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [CUDA] Add NaN-propagating symmetric clamp (#3605)

* [CUDA] Add explicit FP32 symmetric clamp intrinsic

* [CUDA] Add FP16 and BF16 symmetric clamp with packed x2 lowering

* [CUDA] Preserve NaNs in symmetric clamp intrinsics

---------

